# Taiji Project — Windsurf Rules (Powered by Superpowers)

## Identity

This is the **太极 · 易经决策框架** project — a Next.js 15 + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS 4 application.

## Superpowers Integration

This project uses the [Superpowers](https://github.com/obra/superpowers) agentic skills framework.
All skill definitions live in `.windsurf/skills/`. Before any non-trivial task, check if a skill applies.

### Mandatory Workflow

1. **Before writing code** — Check if `brainstorming` or `writing-plans` skill applies
2. **Before implementing** — Follow `test-driven-development` (RED → GREEN → REFACTOR)
3. **When debugging** — Follow `systematic-debugging` (4-phase root cause process)
4. **After completing work** — Follow `verification-before-completion`
5. **Before marking done** — Follow `requesting-code-review` checklist

